"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:8838c458be310b98cb336b4b17e7feef917a4640404c10826fbd3a15e5259e42","file":"preprints/Virtual-compact-specialness-of-hyperbolic-one-relator-groups-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/00-introduction.tex","line":113,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"60f14b44d5c1cda9961b4e2c81423595b815129feac3e5804f009c3ed01bacda","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Virtual-compact-specialness-of-hyperbolic-one-relator-groups-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/00-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:8838c458be310b98cb336b4b17e7feef917a4640404c10826fbd3a15e5259e42","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Virtual-compact-specialness-of-hyperbolic-one-relator-groups-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/00-introduction.tex#L113"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:ascending-intro}\nLet $F$ be a finitely generated free group and let $\\phi:F\\to F$ be injective. If its ascending mapping torus\n\\[\nF*_{\\phi}=\\langle F,t\\mid t^{-1}ft=\\phi(f),\\ f\\in F\\rangle\n\\]\nis word-hyperbolic, then it is virtually compact special."}
